<title>UK: June Flotta to load 6.4 mln bbls in 11 cargoes.</title>
<headline>June Flotta to load 6.4 mln bbls in 11 cargoes.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's North Sea Flotta crude system will load 6.4 million barrels in 11 cargoes in June, up from 4.85 million in eight cargoes in May, traders said.  </p>
<p>Traders said the June programme would be heavier because less maintenance was scheduled than in May.</p>
<p>The programme would be made up of nine cargoes of 600,000 barrels and two of 500,000 barrels, they said.</p>
<p>The original May programme scheduled 5.45 million barrels in nine cargoes but a 600,000-barrel cargo due to load at the end of the month was cancelled.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7930</p>
